hot (changed from Bimbo to avoid being a walking copyright infringement), who had also previously lost his parents to hunters. It turns out the tiger Shere Khan was the one who arranged the death of Simba's father so he could be the king of the jungle, and he wishes to capture Simba with the help of his minions.","description_fr":"Suite à la mort de son père, Simba se doit de reprendre le trône afin de devenir le Roi de la savane. Pour l'aider dans son périple, des fées lui confient le pouvoir de la grande ourse. Notre jeune lionceau entouré de son fidèle ami Bimbo, jeune faon destiné à devenir le roi de la forêt, mais aussi de Bagherra, Baloo, Kaâ et bien d'autres, rencontreront de nombreux pièges du vil tigre Sher-Khan... Les points forts du dvd Cette série télévisée d’animation d’origine italienne et comptant 52 épisodes est diffusée pour la première fois en 1997 sur France 2. Cette adaptation des aventures de Simba diffère quelque peu avec celles du célèbre film de Disney.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjr0smSulVXUD9xKKtsjYESE0jF.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/et9eF01SS5mps5oauyxFIiXDmbI.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.3,"vote_count":13,"age_rating":null,"year":"1995","release_date":"1995-08-01","runtime_minutes":null,"status":"Ended","country":"إيطاليا","language":"الإيطالية","genres":["حركة ومغامرة","رسوم متحركة","أطفال","عائلي","أكشن","كوميدي","دراما"],"genre_keys":["action","animation","kids","family","comedy","drama"],"similar":["tv51817","tv4686","tv15260","tv68073","mv1175942","tv62211","tv44593","tv47480"],"director":null,"cast":[{"name":"Cinzia Massironi","character":"Simba cucciolo (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ear9isjyOrzxcb8Emaxa0LqEkad.jpg"},{"name":"Patrizio Prata","character":"Simba adulto (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7RUGWVNp6uI9GrCEERtjeZmfkUB.jpg"},{"name":"Jasmine Laurenti","character":"Bimbo cucciolo (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w